Abstract = {This paper presents an autonomous road traffic monitoring Edge AI SoC
   implemented in 18nm FD-SOI CMOS. The SoC includes a RISC-V CPU, a 128
   Processing Elements (PE) Single Instruction Multiple Data (SIMD) Tensor
   Processing Unit (TPU) AI accelerator, with QVGA and control interfaces.
   It uses Adaptative-Body-Bias (ABB) process and temperature compensation.
   The circuit operates within 0.5 to 0.87 V, -40 to 140 degrees C,50 to
   500 MHz ranges. The TPU efficiency energy per inference and latency are
   3.52 mu J and 0.616 ms when running MobileNet v1 stripped by 2 layers,
